<title>NORWAY: Nycomed share up on takeover report.</title>
<headline>Nycomed share up on takeover report.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Norwegian pharmaceutical group Nycomed ASA jumped on Friday on a report that it may be taken over by German chemicals and pharmaceuticals group Altana AG, brokers said.</p>
<p>Nycomed's A share was up 3.85 percent to 108.50 crowns at 1030 GMT on the Oslo Stock Exchange. It was the third most traded share in Oslo at 28 million crowns.</p>
